{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready for the ultimate driving experience?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving Simulator just got a massive update!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you can explore <strong>brand new cars</strong>, test your skills in <strong>new game modes</strong> (Freeroam, Racing, Drift, Drag) and push your limits like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a growing collection of vehicles \u2013 from supercars and motorcycles to unique rides \u2013 and take them for a spin on challenging maps. Customize your car\u2019s look and performance, then prove your driving skills in multiple modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to relax in Freeroam, compete in high-speed Racing, or master drifting, the choice is yours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 11 vehicles to choose (new cars added!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 6 diverse maps with different challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- New Game Modes: <strong>Freeroam, Racing, Drift, Drag</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0 Visual upgrades &amp; car customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Damage System &amp; realistic physics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- POV Camera Drive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- More features &amp; updates coming soon!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1592390?t=1758380686","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1592390?t=1758380686","capsule_image":null,"capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592390/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758380686","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready for the ultimate driving experience?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving Simulator just got a massive update!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you can explore <strong>brand new cars</strong>, test your skills in <strong>new game modes</strong> (Freeroam, Racing, Drift, Drag) and push your limits like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a growing collection of vehicles \u2013 from supercars and motorcycles to unique rides \u2013 and take them for a spin on challenging maps. Customize your car\u2019s look and performance, then prove your driving skills in multiple modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to relax in Freeroam, compete in high-speed Racing, or master drifting, the choice is yours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 11 vehicles to choose (new cars added!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 6 diverse maps with different challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- New Game Modes: <strong>Freeroam, Racing, Drift, Drag</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0 Visual upgrades &amp; car customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Damage System &amp; realistic physics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- POV Camera Drive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- More features &amp; updates coming soon!</p>","developers":["CataStoica"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592390/header.jpg?t=1758380686","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},